      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "\"Multi select editing in general is pretty laggy as well. (try adding a source to multiple constraints at once and unity will hang for a decent chunk of time)\"\n\nThis may be another case of this existing known issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1471-vrchat-freeze-on-loading-complex-constraint-pattern\n\nIf possible, please check if Unity hangs specifically when you create a circular dependency between three or more constraints, i.e. A -> B -> C -> A. If this is not the cause, please consider opening a separate Canny issue so the problem can be tracked separately from this one. Thanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
