  "details": "You cannot multi select constraints and use the \"activate\" button to do so to every object. You can check mark the \"is active\" on multiple. However, doing that does not reset the offsets like the activate button does.\n\nEdit: Multi select editing in general is pretty laggy as well. (try adding a source to multiple constraints at once and unity will hang for a decent chunk of time)",
